Subject: [PATCH 0012/0014] Server runtime configuration

This patch configures the server runtime for workspace VMs: data
folder, socket paths, and the signed-token session handshake with the
gateway. The server listens on the workspace loopback only and never
accepts direct Internet connections.

Diff: authored on the upstream checkout (see build.sh).
Verification: server boot smoke test inside a workspace VM.
